---
// Careers Section
---

<section id="careers" class="careers">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      <h2 class="heading">Join the <span>Flyger Team</span></h2>
      <p class="text">
        We are always looking for passionate aviation professionals. Elevate your career by joining a fast-paced, global company dedicated to excellence and innovation.
      </p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">View Open Positions</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .careers {
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem 3rem;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #0D2137, #1A365D);
    color: white;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .heading {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .heading span {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.85rem 2.5rem;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
</style>
